}, {"t_ms": 53813, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01WSJikW7siZjnQkaFk89VsP", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53813, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01WSJikW7siZjnQkaFk89VsP", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 55190, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01VXzGCromfP848fQvrDZnJx", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55490, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01VXzGCromfP848fQvrDZnJx", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55490, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01VXzGCromfP848fQvrDZnJx", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 60451, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is back on v2.3.0 in all three regions and is healthy again. The error rate dropped from about 18% to about 0.2%. SEV2 incident INC-0001 is open.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.1 is the release that broke health checks. v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production, so that's the version I rolled back to.\n- The first rollback attempt failed partway because of an orchestrator error. Only us-east switched to v2.3.0, while us-west and eu-west stayed on v2.3.1.\n- I ran the same rollback again and it finished in all regions. us-east, us-west and eu-west now all run v2.3.0.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create the SEV2 incident timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and saw it had been created anyway. I didn't resend it, to avoid a duplicate incident and a second page to on-call.\n- It records what happened, the partial rollback and retry, the current state, and three follow-ups:\n  - Find out what broke v2.3.1.\n  - Find out what caused the orchestrator error during the rollback.\n  - Find out why v2.3.1 was released to production when its test build (v2.3.1-rc) was also unhealthy in staging.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01DiBgwXfvoUD3qKaNunCAuR", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01UrsWxgGKfQCbjxQMukyB9j", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy production release is v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_017ZcoN1m1454kbQqovxMJgP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Y9CAQYKFvoEEP8zbkHuMzb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Partial rollback: us-east is on v2.3.0, while us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Retrying the rollback, which should be safe since it targets the same version.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_011x4EtygzoYmLc1UVtEczhz", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01RVV3yHF5xFZod9s68x